@using Dchien.Legal.Common
@using Dchien.Legal.Service
@using Newtonsoft.Json.Linq
@model Dchien.Legal.Web.Areas.FAM.ViewModels.Invoice.InvoiceModel 

<div class="modal fade" id="invoiceNoChangeModal">
    <div class="modal-dialog" >
        <div class="modal-content">
            @using (Html.BeginForm("InvoiceNoChange", "Invoice", FormMethod.Post, new {id = "invoiceNoChangeForm", @class = "form-horizontal ng-invalid ng-invalid-required"}))
            {
                <div class="modal-header">
                    <button type="button" class="close" id="btnInvoiceNoChangeClose">×</button>
                    <h5 class="modal-title ">修改发票编号</h5>
                </div>

                <div class="modal-body">
                    <div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label class="col-sm-3 control-label">
                                <span class="text-danger"></span>
                                <span class="">请票单号</span>
                            </label>
                            <div class="col-sm-6">
                                @Html.HiddenFor(m => m.Invoice.InvoiceBasic.InvoiceId)
                                @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.Invoice.InvoiceBasic.InvoiceApplicationNo, new {@class = "input_text form-control", @readonly=true,@autocomplete = "off"})
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label class="col-sm-3 control-label">
                                <span class="text-danger"></span>
                                <span>合同编号</span>
                            </label>
                            <div class="col-sm-6">
                                @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.Invoice.InvoiceBasic.ContractNo, new {@class = "input_text form-control",@readonly=true})
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label class="col-sm-3 control-label">
                                <span class="text-danger"></span>
                                <span>原发票号码</span>
                            </label>
                            <div class="col-sm-6">
                                @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.Invoice.InvoiceBasic.InvoiceNo, new {@class = "input_text form-control",@readonly=true})
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label class="col-sm-3 control-label">
                                <span class="text-danger">*</span>
                                <span>新发票号码</span>
                            </label>
                            <div class="col-sm-6">
                                <input class="input_text form-control" id="Invoice_InvoiceBasic_NewInvoiceNo" name="Invoice.InvoiceBasic.NewInvoiceNo" type="text" value="">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="modal-footer">

                    <input class="btn btn-primary " type="button" id="btnInvoiceNoChange" value="确定" />
                    <input class="btn btn-default " type="button" id="btnInvoiceNoChangeCancel" value="取消" />
                </div>
            }

        </div>
    </div>
</div>

